Per-entity relevancy policy. Distance = culled against the client's
viewer position; Always = every client (gamemode/global state);
Never = server-only, never replicated.

members.doc:
On-screen keyboard (Deck Verified requires one for every text field a
controller can reach). False when the platform has none or refused;
onDone runs once, when the keyboard closes.

types.doc:
The typed array. TItem derives from FNetFastArrayItem and provides
void NetSerialize(FNetBitWriter& w) const;
bool NetDeserialize(FNetBitReader& r);
Removal on the server is an ordinary erase from Items followed by
MarkArrayDirty(). Callbacks run on the receiver only.
